hadiths[60]{hadithnumber,text}:
"3643","Aaraj ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : aurat ko pasli se paida kya gaya hai, wo tumharey liye kisi aik tareeqey par hargiz seedhi nahi reh sakti, agar tum us se fayda uthana chaho to (usi tarah) fayda utha logey ke usmein tedh rahegi aur agar tum usey seedha karne chalogey to usey tod dalogey, aur usey todna uski talaaq hai."
"3644","abu-Hazim ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jo Allah aur qiyamat ke din par eman rakhta hai jab (apni biwi mein) koi ( pasand na aaney wala ( mamla dekhey to achi tarah se baat kahey ya khamosh rahe aur aurton ke sath achchhey sulook ki nasihat qabool karo kyonke aurat pasli se paida ki gaee hai. aur pasliyon mein sabse zyada tedh uske uper waley hissey mein hai. agar tum usey seedha karne lag jaogey to usey tod doge aur agar chhod doge to wo tedhi hi rahegi, aurton ke sath achchhey sulook ki nasihat qabool karo."
"3645","Esa-bin-Yonus ne hamein hadis bayan ki, kaha : hamein Abdul-Hameed bin Jafar ne Imran bin abi Anas se hadis sunai, unhon-ne Umar-bin Hakam se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : Allah ke rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : koi momin mard kisi momina aurat se bughz na rakhey. agar usey uski koi aadat na-pasand hai to dusri pasand hogi. ya aap ne (iske siwa koi aur) farmaya."
"3646","abu-Aasim ne hamein hadis bayan ki, kaha : hamein abdul-hameed bin Jafar ne pichhli sanad ke sath Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki. usi ki tarah."
"3647","Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ke aazad karda ghulam abu Yunus ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki ke aap ne farmaya : agar Hawa (Alaihissalam) na hotin to koi aurat apne shauhar se kabhi khayanat na karti."
"3648","Hammam-bin-Munabba se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha : ye hadisein hain jo Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne hamein Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se bayan kin, phir unhon-ne bahut si hadisein bayan kin, unmein aik ye thi : aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : agar Bani-Israeel na hotey to khana kharab na hota aur gosht badbudar na hota aur agar hawa (Alaihissalam) na hotin to koi aurat apne shauhar se khayanat na karti."
"3649","Saiyedna Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : '' duniya kaam nikalney ki cheez hai aur behtar kaam nikalney ki cheez duniya mein nek aurat hai.''"
"3650","Yunus ne mujhey ibne-Shahab se khabar di, kaha : mujhey ibne-Musaiyab ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : bila shubah aurat pasli ki tarah hai, agar tum usey seedha karne lag jaogey to usey tod dalogey aur agar usey chhod doge to us se fayda uthaogey jabke usmein tedhaapan (maujood) hoga."
"3651","Zohri ke bhatijey ne apne chacha (Zohri ( se isi sanad ke sath bilkul usi ki tarah riwayat ki."
"3652","imam Malik-bin-Anas ne Naafe se, unhon-ne Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke ahad main apni biwi ko jabke wo haaiza thi, talaaq de di. Hazrat Umar-bin-Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) ne iske barey mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se puchha to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse farmaya : usey hukm do ke wo us se rujoo karey, phir usey rehney de yahan tak ke wo paak ho jaey (paki shuru ho jaey), phir usey haiz aa jaey, phir wo paak ho jaey. phir agar wo chahey to iske baad usey apne paas rakhey aur agar chahey to us se mujamiat (sambhog) karne se pahley talaaq de dey . yahi wo iddat hai jiska Allah ne hukm diya hai ke iske mutabiq aurton ko talaaq di jaey."
"3653","Yahya-bin-Yahya , Qutaiba-bin-Saeed aur ibne- Rumeh ne hamein hadis bayan ki. padhi. alfaz Yahya ke hain. padhi. Quteba ne kaha : hamein Leis ne hadis sunai aur doosrey donon ne kaha : hamein Lais-bin-Sad ne Naafe se khabar di, unhon-ne kaha : Hazrat Abdullah (bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu)) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne apni biwi ko jab wo haiz ki haalat mein thi aik talaaq di, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein hukm diya ke wo us se rujoo karein, phir usey (apne paas ( rokein yahan tak ke wo paak ho jaey, phir unke yahaan usey dobara haiz aaey, phir usey mohlat dein yahan tak ke wo ( phir se) apne haiz se paak ho jaey. iske baad agar usey talaaq dena chaahein to paki ke zamaney mein, iske sath mujamiat (sambhog) karne se pahley usey talaaq dein. yahi wo iddat hai jiska Allah ne hukm diya hai ke iske mutabiq aurton ko talaaq di jaey. ibne-Rumeh ne apni riwayat mein ye izafa kiya : Hazrat Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se jab is (masle) ke barey mein sawal kiya jata to wo unmein se kisi se kehtey : agar tum ne apni biwi ko aik ya do martaba talaaq di hai (to rujoo karo). kyonke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujhey iska hukm diya tha aur agar tum usey teen talaaqein de chukey ho to wo tum par haram ho gaee hai. yahan tak ke wo tumharey siwa kisi aur shauhar se nikah kare. tum ne is hukm mein, jo usney tumhari biwi ki talaaq ke barey main tumhen diya hai, Allah ki nafarmani ki hai. Imam Muslim (Rehmatullahi-alaih) ne kaha : Leis ne apne (riwaayat ki hui) qaul aik talaaq (ko mehfooz rakhney aur bayan karne ke mamley) mein bahut achchha kaam kiya hai."
"3654","Abdullah-bin-Numair ne hamein hadis bayan ki, (kaha : ( hamein Ubaidullah ne Naafe se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke ahade-mubaarak main apni biwi ko jab wo haiz ki haalat mein thi, talaaq de di. Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne ye baat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko batai to aap ne farmaya : usey hukm do ke us se rujoo karey phir usey (apne paas rakh) chhodey yahan tak ke wo paak ho jaey. phir usey doosra haiz aaey, iske baad jab wo paak ho jaey to mubashrat karne se pahley usey talaaq de ya usey apne paas rakhey. bila shubah yahi wo iddat hai jiska Allah Taala ne hukm diya hai ke iske mutabiq aurton ko talaaq di jaey. Ubaidullah ne kaha : maine Naafe se puchha : talaaq ka kya kiya gaya? unhon-ne jawab diya : wo aik thi, usko shumaar kiya gaya."
"3655","abu-Bakar-bin-abi-Sheba aur ibne- Musanna ne bhi hamein yahi hadis sunai, un donon ne kaha : hamein Abdullah-bin-Idris ne Ubaidullah se isi sanad ke sath usi ke ham mana hadis bayan ki, taaham (phir bhi) unhon-ne Naafe se Ubaidullah ke sawal ka tazkira nahi kiya. ibne-Musanna ne apni riwayat mein (usey lota ley) kaha, aur Abu-Bakar ne : (is se rujoo karey) kaha."
"3656","Ayub ne Naafe se riwayat ki ke Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne apni biwi ko haiz ki haalat mein talaaq de di. Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne (iske barey mein) Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se sawal kiya, to aap ne unhein hukm diya ke wo ( ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu)) is aurat se rujoo karey, phir usey mohlat de yahan tak ke usey doosra haiz aaey, phir usey mohlat de yahan tak ke wo paak ho jaey, phir usey chhooney (mujamiat karne) se pahley talaaq de. yahi wo iddat hai jiska Allah Taala ne hukm diya hai ke iske mutabiq aurton ko talaaq di jaey. (Naafe ne) kaha : Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se jab us aadmi ke barey mein puchha jata jo apni biwi ko haalatey-haiz mein talaaq de deta hai to wo kehtey : agar tum ne aik ya do talaaqein di hain (to rujoo kar saktey ho kyonke ( Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein hukm diya tha ke us se rujoo karein, phir usey mohlat dein yahan tak ke usey doosra haiz aaey, ( farmaya : ( phir usey mohlat dein yahan tak ke wo paak ho jaey, phir us se mujamiat (sambhog) karne se pahley usey talaaq dein. aur agar tum ne teen talaaqein di hain to tum ne apne rab ke hukm mein jo usney tumhari biwi ki talaaq ke hawale se tumhen diya hai, uski nafarmani ki hai aur (ab) wo tum se ( mustaqil taur par) juda ho gaee hai."
"3657","imam Zohri ke bhatijey Muhammad ne hamein apne chacha Zohri se hadis bayan ki, (kaha : ( hamein Saalim-bin-Abdullah ne khabar di ke Hazrat Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : maine apni biwi ko is haalat mein talaaq di ke wo haaiza thi. Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne ye baat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko batai to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) sakht ghussey mein aaey, phir farmaya : usey hukm do ke us se rujoo karey taake usey us haiz ke siwa jis mein us ne usey talaaq di hai doosra haiz shuru ho jaey. iske baad agar wo usey talaaq dena chahey to usey (doosrey haiz ke baad) paak honey ki haalat mein, mubashrat karne se pahley talaaq de. yahi iddat ke mutabiq talaaq hai jis tarah Allah ne hukm diya hai. aur Hazrat Abdullah (bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu)) ne usey aik talaaq di thi aur uski wo talaaq shumaar ki gaee aur Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) ne, jis tarah Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein hukm diya tha, us se rujoo kiya."
"3658","Zubaidi ne Zohri se isi sanad ke sath ye hadis bayan ki, lekin unhon-ne kaha : Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne farmaya : maine us se rujoo kar liya aur uski wo talaaq shumaar kar li gaee jo maine usey di thi."
"3659","abu-Talha ke aazad karda ghulam Muhammad-bin Abdur-Rehman ne Salim se, unhon-ne Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke unhon-ne apni biwi ko jabke wo haaiza thi, talaaq de di. Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne ye baat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kahi to aap ne farmaya : usey hukm do ke wo us ( mutallaqa biwi ( se rujoo karey, phir usey paki ki haalat mein ya haalate-hamal mein talaaq de. ( hamal mein talaaq di jaeygi to waza' hamal tak aasani se iddat ka shumaar ho sakega."
"3660","Abdullah-bin-Dinar ne ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se hadis bayan ki ke unhon-ne apni biwi ko jabke wo haaiza thi talaaq di, Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se iske barey mein puchha to aap ne farmaya : usey hukm do ke us se rujoo karey yahan tak ke wo ( haiz se) paak ho jaey, phir usey dobara haiz aa jaey, phir paak ho jaey, phir iske baad usey talaaq de ya (apne paas ( rok ley."
"3661","Ismail-bin-Ibrahim ne hamein Ayub se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Ibne-Sirin se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : maine bees-saal twaqquf kiya (thehra raha). mujhey aisey log jinhein main muttahim (jis par jhoot waigheira ka ilzaam laga ho) nahi samajhta tha hadis bayan kartey rahe ke Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne apni biwi ko jabke wo haaiza thi teen talaaqein de-di to unhein us se rujoo karne ka hukm diya gaya. maine ye kiya ke main unhein muttahim nahi karta tha. lekin hadis (ki haqiqat ( ko bhi nahi janta tha. yahan tak ke meri mulaqat abu-ghillaab Younus-bin-Juber Bahili se hui. wo bahut zabt waley they. ( hadis ko bahut achi tarah yad rakhney waley they) unhon-ne mujhey hadis bayan ki ke unhon-ne khud ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se puchha tha, unhon-ne unko hadis bayan ki ke unhon-ne apni biwi ko haiz ki haalat mein aik talaaq di thi to unhein hukm diya gaya ke wo us se rujoo karein. kaha : maine kaha : kya usey talaaq shumaar kiya gaya? unhon-ne jawab diya : kyon nahi ! agar koi ( aadmi ( khud hi ( sahi tareeqey par talaaq deney se) aajiz aa gaya ho aur) haalatey-haiz mein talaaq de kar) himaaqat se kaam liya ho (to kya talaaq na hogi.)"
"3662","Hammad ne Ayub se isi sanad ke sath usi ke ham mana hadis bayan ki, albatta unhon-ne kaha : Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se malum kiya to aap ne unhein hukm diya (ke ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ye karein.)"
"3663","Abdul-Waris-bin-Abdus-Samad ke dada Abdul-Waris-bin-Saeed ne Ayub se isi sanad ke sath (yahi) riwayat bayan ki aur (apni) hadis mein kaha : Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se iske barey mein sawal kiya to aap ne unhein hukm diya ke wo ( ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu)) us se rujoo karey yahan tak ke usey paki ki haalat mein mujamiat (sambhog) kiye baghair talaaq de, aur kaha : wo usey iddat ke shuruat mein talaaq de. (yani us paki ki shuruat mein jis se iddat shumaar honi hai."
"3664","Yunus ne Muhammad-bin-Sirin se, unhon-ne Younus-bin-Juber se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : maine ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se kaha : aik aadmi ne apni biwi ko haalate haiz mein talaaq di hai? to unhon-ne kaha : kya tum Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ko jantey ho? us ne apni biwi ko haiz ki haalat mein talaaq di thi. Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaey aur aap se malum kiya to aap ne usey (ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ko) hukm diya ke wo us se rujoo karey. phir wo (aurat agar usey dusri paki mein mujamiat (sambhog) kiye baghair talaaq di jaey to wahan se) aagey iddat shumaar kare. kaha : maine un ( ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu)) se puchha : agar koi aadmi apni biwi ko haalate-haiz mein talaaq de to kya us talaaq ko shumaar kiya jaeyga? kaha : unhon-ne kaha : to (aur) kya? agar wo khud hi ( sahi tariqa ikhtiyar karne se) aajiz raha aur us ne himaaqat se kaam liya (to kya talaaq shumaar na hogi.)"
"3665","Qatada se riwayat hai unhon-ne kaha : maine Younus-bin-Juber se suna unhon-ne kaha maine ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ko ye kehtey huey suna : maine apni biwi ko haalate-haiz mein talaaq di, is par Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huey aur aapko ye baat batai to Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : wo us se rujoo karey, iske baad jab wo paak ho jaey to agar wo chahey usey talaaq de dey. (Younus ne) kaha : maine ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se puchha : kya aap us talaaq ko shumaar karengey? unhon-ne kaha : is se kya cheez rukawat hai? tumhari kya raey hai? agar wo khud (sahi tariqa ikhtiyar karne se) aajiz raha aur naadaani wala kaam kiya (to talaaq kyon shumaar na hogi !)"
"3666","Abdul-Malik ne Anas-bin-Sirin se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : maine Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se unki us biwi ke barey mein sawal kiya jisey unhon-ne talaaq di thi. unhon-ne kaha : maine usey haalate-haiz mein talaaq di thi. maine ye baat Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ko batai to unhon-ne yahi baat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko batai. is par aap ne farmaya : usey hukm do ke wo us se rujoo karey aur jab wo paak ho jaey to usey uski paki mein talaaq de. kaha : maine us ( biwi ( se rujoo kya, phir iske paki mein usey talaaq di. maine puchha : aap ne wo talaaq shumaar ki jo usey haalate haiz mein di thi? unhon-ne jawab diya : main usey kyon shumaar na karta? agar main khud hi ( sahi tariqa apnaaney se) aajiz raha tha aur himaaqat se kaam liya tha (to kya talaaq shumaar na hogi !)"
"3667","Muhammad-bin-Jafar ne hamein hadis sunai, unhon-ne kaha : hamein Shoba ne Anas-bin-Sirin se hadis bayan ki ke unhon-ne Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, unhon-ne kaha : maine apni biwi ko us haalat mein talaaq di ke wo haaiza thi, is par Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huey aur aapko bataya to aap ne farmaya : usey hukm do ke us se rujoo karey, phir jab wo paak ho jaey to tab usey talaaq de. maine Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se puchha : kya aap ne us talaaq ko shumaar kiya tha? unhon-ne kaha : to (aur ( kya !"
"3668","Khalid-bin-Haaris aur Behaz donon ne kaha : hamein Shoba ne isi sanad se hadis bayan ki, lekin un donon ki hadis mein (us se rujoo karne ki bajaey) (wo usko lota ley) hai. aur un donon ki hadis mein ye bhi hai, kaha : maine unse puchha : kya aap us talaaq ko shumaar karengey ? unhon-ne jawab diya : to (aur ( kya !"
"3669","(Abdullah) ibne-Taaus ne apne walid se riwayat ki ke unhon-ne ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, unse aisey aadmi ke barey mein sawal kiya ja raha tha jisne apni biwi ko haiz ki haalat mein talaaq di. unhon-ne kaha : kya tum Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ko jantey ho? usne kaha : haan , unhon-ne kaha : unhon-ne apni biwi ko haiz mein talaaq de di thi. to Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas gaey aur aapko us khabar se aagah kiya. aap ne unhein hukm diya ke wo us se rujoo kare. ( ibne- Taaus ne) kaha : maine apne walid ko is se zyada bayan kartey huey nahi suna."
"3670","Hujjaj-bin-Muhammad ne hamein hadis bayan ki, kaha : ibne-Juraij ne kaha : mujhey abu-Zubair ne khabar di ke unhon-ne azzah ke Maula Abdur-Rehman-bin-aiman se suna, wo Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se poochh rahe they aur abu-Zubair bhi ye baat sun rahe they ke aap ki us aadmi ke barey mein kya raey hai jisne apni biwi ko haiz ki haalat mein talaaq de di? unhon-ne jawab diya : ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne bhi Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke zamaney main apni biwi ko haalate-haiz mein talaaq di thi to Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne iske barey mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se sawal kiya aur bataya : Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne apni biwi ko haiz ki haalat mein talaaq de di hai to Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse farmaya : wo us se rujoo kare. chunanche unhon-ne us se rujoo kar liya, aur aap ne farmaya : jab wo paak ho jaey to usey talaaq de ya (apne yahaan basaaey ( rakhey. Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : aur Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne (ye aayat ( tilawat farmai : aey Nabi ! jab aap log aurton ko talaaq dein to unhein unki iddat ( shuru karne) ke waqt talaaq dein."
"3671","abu-Aasim ne ibne-Juraij se, unhon-ne abu-Zubair se aur unhon-ne ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se usi waqiey ke mutabiq riwayat ki."
"3672","Abdur-Razzaq ne hamein hadis bayan ki, (kaha : ( hamein ibne-Juraij ne khabar di, (kaha : ( mujhey abu-Zubair ne khabar di ke unhon-ne Urwa ke Maula Abdur-Rehman-bin-aiman se suna, wo Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se poochh rahe they, aur abu-Zubair bhi sun rahe they. jis tarah Hajjaj ki hadis hai aur us ( hadis) mein kuchh izafa bhi hai. Imam Muslim (Rehmatullahi-alaih) ne kaha : unhon-ne jo Maula Urwa kaha hai, usmein ghalati ki, wo Maula azzah they."
"3770","Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai Rasulullah ne farmaya jo shakhs apna hissey aazad karey barda mein se (yani wo barda mushtarak ho) aur aik Sharik apna hissey aazad karey aur phir aazad karne waley ke paas is qadr maal ho jo bardey ki qeemat ko pahunch ‌jaey to us bardey ki waajibi qeemat lagai jaey aur baqi sharikon ko in ke hissey ki qeemat iske maal main se di jaeygi aur kal barda uski taraf se aazad ho jaeyga ‌ aur jo wo maaldar na ho to jis qadr hissey us barda ka aazad hua itna hi aazad rahega. ‌"
"3771","isi hadis ki dusri asnaad mazkoor hain."
"3772","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai Rasulullah ‌(sl) ne farmaya ‌ : jo barda 2 aadmiyon mein mushtarak ho phir aik Sharik apna hissey aazad kar dewe to wo zaamin hoga doosrey Sharik ke hissey ka (agar maal daar ho ("
"3773","Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai Rasulullah ‌(sl) ne farmaya ‌ : jo shakhs apna hissey ghulam main aazad kar de to uska chhudana (yani doosrey hissey ka bhi aazad karna) bhi isi ke maal se hoga agar maaldaar ho, agar maaldaar na ho to ghulam mahnat mazduri karey aur is par jabr na karein  ."
"3774","tarjama dusri riwayat ka bhi wahi hai jo uper guzra us main itna zyada hai ke agar wo aazad karne wala maaldaar na ho to ghulam ki waajibi qeemat lagai jaey aur mahnat karey apne baqi hissey ke liye jo aazad nahi hua magar is par jabr nahi hoga."
"3775","Qatada (Raziallahu anhu) ne ‌ibne-abi Aruba ki hadis ki manind (tarah) riwayat ki aur hadis mein ye bhi zikr kya ke uski waajibi qeemat lagai jaey."
"3776","Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat ki ke unhon-ne aik londi khareed kar usey aazad karne ka irada kya. uske maalikon ne kaha : ham is shart par ye kaneez aapko bechengey ke iska haqe-'walaa' hamara hoga. Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne is baat ka zikr Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kya to aap ne farmaya : ye ( shart ( tumhen ( usko khareed kar aazad karne se) na rokey (is kaneez ko zaroor aazadi milni chahiye) bila shubah 'walaa' ka haq usi ka hai jisne ( ghulam ya kaneez ko) aazad kya."
"3777","Leis ne hamein ibne-Shahab se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Urwa se riwayat ki, Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne unhein khabar di ke Barira (Raziallahu anhu) Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ke paas aai. wo unse apni makaatibat ( qeemat ada karke aazaadi ka muaahida karne) ke silsiley mein madad maang rahi thi. us ne apni makaatibat ki raqam mein se kuchh bhi ada nahi kiya tha. Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne us se kaha : apne maalikon ke paas jao, agar wo pasand karein ke main tumhari makaatibat (likhai) ki raqam ada karun aur tumhara haq 'walaa' mere liye ho, to main ( tumhari qeemat ki adaaeygi ( kar dun gi. Barira (Raziallahu anhu) ne ye apne maalikon se kahi to unhon-ne inkar kar diya, aur kaha : agar wo tumharey sath neki karna chahti hain to karein, lekin tumhari 'walaa' ka haq hamara hi hoga. is par unhon (Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ( ne ye baat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se ki. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse kaha : tum khareed lo aur aazad kar do, kyonke 'walaa' ka haq usi ka hai jisne aazad kiya. phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) (member par) khadey huey aur farmaya : logon ko kya hua hai? wo aisi shartein rakhtey hain jo Allah ki kitab (ki taalimat ( mein nahi. jisne aisi shart rakhi jo Allah ki kitab mein nahi hai to usey iska koi haq nahi chahey wo sou martaba shart rakh ley. Allah ki shart zyada haq rakhti hai aur wahi zyada mazbut hai."
"3778","Yunus ne mujhey ibne-Shahab se khabar di, unhon-ne Urwa-bin-Zubair se, unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki ahliya Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : Barira (Raziallahu anhu) mere paas aai aur kehney lagi : Aaisha ! maine apne maalikon se nou (9) auqiya par makaatibat ( qeemat ki adaaeygi par aazad ho janey ka muaahida ( kiya hai, har saal mein aik auqiya ( 40 dirham ada karna ( hai, aagey Leis ki hadis ke ham mana hai aur (is mein) ye izafa kiya ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : tumhen unki ye baat ( Barira ko aazad karne se) na rokey . usey khareedo aur aazad kar do aur) Yunus ne) hadis mein kaha : phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) logon mein khadey huey, Allah ki hamd aur sana bayan ki, phir farmaya : ammaa ba'd ! (khutba diya jis mein shart wali baat irshad farmai.)."
"3779","abu-Usama ne kaha : hamein Hisham-bin-Urwa ne hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne kaha : mujhey mere walid ne Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se khabar di, unhon-ne kaha : Barira (Raziallahu anhu) mere paas aai aur kehney lagi : mere maalikon ne mere sath nou (9) saalon mein nou (9) auqiya (ki adaaeygi (ke badley makaatibat (aazadi ki baat ( ki hai. har saal mein aik auqiya ( ada karna ( hai. meri madad karein. maine us se kaha : agar tumharey Malik chaahein ke main unhein yak-musht gin dun aur tumhen aazad kar dun aur 'walaa' ka haq mera ho. to main aisa kar loongi. us ne ye baat apne maalikon se ki to unhon-ne (usey man-ney se) inkar kar diya siwaey-iske ke haq 'walaa' unka ho. iske baad wo mere paas aai aur ye baat mujhey batai, kaha : to maine is par barhami ka izhar kiya, aur kaha : Allah ki qism ! phir aisa nahi ho sakta. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ye baat suni to mujh se poochha, maine aapko ( poori ( baat batai to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : usey khareedo aur aazad kar do, unke liye 'walaa' ki shart rakh lo, kyonke (asl mein to) 'walaa' (sarparasti) ka haq usi ka hai jisne aazad kiya. maine aisa hi kiya. kaha : phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Sham ke waqt khutba diya, Allah ki hamd aur sana jo iske shaayaan shaan thi bayan ki, phir farmaya : ammaa ba'd! logon ko kya hua hai? wo aisi shartein rakhtey hain jo Allah ki kitab mein (jaaiz) nahi. jo bhi shart Allah ki kitab mein (rawaa) nahi, wo baatil hai, chahey wo sou (100) shartein hon, Allah ki kitab hi sabse sachchi aur Allah ki shart sabse mazbut hai. tum mein se kuchh logon ko kya hua hai? unmein se koi kehta hai : falan ko aazad tum karo aur haq 'walaa' mera hoga. ( halanke ( 'walaa' ka haq usi ka hai jisne aazad kiya."
"3780","ibne-Numair , Wakee aur Jarir sab ne Hisham-bin-Urwa se isi sanad ke sath abu-Usama ki hadis ke ham mana riwayat bayan ki, lekin Jarir ki hadis mein hai, kaha is ( Barira (Raziallahu anhu)) ka shauhar ghulam tha, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usey ( shadi bar-qaraar rakhney ya na rakhney ke barey mein) ikhtiyar diya to usne khud ko) nikah ki bandish se aazad dekhnaa ( pasand kiya. agar uska shauhar aazad hota to aap usey ye ikhtiyar na detey, aur unki hadis mein ammaa ba'd ! ke alfaz nahi hain. (ye alfaz khutbey ki taraf ishara kartey hain.)"
"3781","Hisham-bin-Urwa ne hamein Abdur-Rehman-bin-Qasim se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne apne walid se, unhon-ne Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat ki, kaha : Barira (Raziallahu anhu) ke mamley mein teen faisley huey : uske maalikon ne chaha ke usey bech dein aur uske haq 'walaa' ko (apne liye) mashroot (shart ke saath) kar dein, maine ye baat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko batai to aap ne farmaya : usey khareedo aur aazad kar do, kyonke 'walaa' usi ka haq hai jisne aazad kiya. ( Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne) kaha : wo aazad hui to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usey ikhtiyar diya, us ne apni zaat (ko aazad rakhney) ka intikhab kiya. (hazrat Aaisha ne) kaha : log is par sadqa kartey they aur wo (us mein se kuchh ( hamein hadiya karti thi, maine ye baat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kahi to aap ne farmaya : wo is par sadqa hai aur tum logon ke liye hadiya hai, lihaza usey kha liya karo."
"3782","Simak ne Abdur-Rehman-bin-Qasim se, unhon-ne apne walid se, unhon-ne Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat ki ke unhon-ne Barira (Raziallahu anhu) ko Ansar ke logon se khareeda , unhon-ne 'walaa' ki shart lagai , to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : 'walaa' (ka haq ( usi ke liye hai jisne ( aazaadi ki) nemat ka ehtimaam kiya. aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usey ikhtiyar diya. jabke uska shauhar ghulam tha. aur us ne Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ko gosht hadiya kiya, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : agar tum hamarey liye us gosht se ( saalan ( taiyaar kartin ? Hazrat Aaisha ne kaha : ye ( gosht ( Barira (Raziallahu anhu) par sadqa kiya gaya tha to aap ne farmaya : wo uske liye sadqa tha aur hamarey liye hadiya hai."
"3783","hamein Muhammad-bin-Jafar ne hadis bayan ki, kaha : hamein Shoba ne hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne kaha : maine Abdur-Rehman-bin-Qasim se suna, unhon-ne kaha : maine Qasim se suna, wo Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se hadis bayan kar rahe they ke unhon-ne Barira (Raziallahu anhu) ko aazad karne ke liye khareednaa chaha to un logon ( maalikon ( ne uski 'walaa' ki shart laga di. Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne is baat ka tazkira Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kiya, to aap ne farmaya : usey khareedo aur aazad kar do kyonke 'walaa' usi ke liye hai jisne aazad kiya. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke liye ( Barira (Raziallahu anhu) ki taraf se) gosht ka hadiya bheja gaya to unhon ( ghar walon ( ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaha : ye Barira par sadqa kiya gaya hai, aap ne farmaya : wo uske liye sadqa hai aur hamarey liye hadiya hai. aur usey ikhtiyar diya gaya. Abdur-Rehman ne kaha : uska shauhar aazad tha. Shoba ne kaha : maine phir se uske shauhar ke barey mein unse puchha to unhon-ne kaha : main nahi janta (wo aazad tha ya ghulam . shak ke baghair , yaqin ke sath ki gaee riwayat yahi hai ke wo ghulam tha.)"
"3784","Abu-Dawud ne hamein hadis bayan ki, (kaha : ( hamein Shoba ne isi sanad se usi ke ham mana hadis bayan ki."
"3785","Urwa ne Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : Barira (Raziallahu anhu) ka shauhar ghulam tha."
"3786","Rabee-bin-abu-Abdur-Rehman ne Qasim-bin-Muhammad se, unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki ahliya Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat ki ke unhon-ne kaha : Barira (Raziallahu anhu) ke mamley mein teen sunnatein ( mutaiyan ( huin : jab wo aazad hui to uske shauhar ke hawale se usey ikhtiyar diya gaya. usey gosht ka hadiya bheja gaya, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) mere yahan tashrif laey to handiya choolhey par thi, aap ne khana talab farmaya to aapko roti aur ghar ke saalanon mein se aik saalan pesh kiya gaya, aap ne farmaya : kya maine aag par chadhi handiya nahi dekhi jis mein gosht tha? ghar walon ne jawab diya : kyon nahi, Allah ke rasool ! wo gosht Barira (Raziallahu anhu) par sadqa kiya gaya tha to hamein achchha na laga ke ham aapko usmein se khilaaein . Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne faraayaa : wo is par sadqa hai aur uski taraf se hamarey liye hadiya hai. Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usi ( Barira (Raziallahu anhu)) ke barey mein farmaya tha : haq 'walaa' usi ke liye hai jisne aazad kiya."
"3787","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha : Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne chaha ke aik londi khareed kar aazad karein to uske maalikon ne ( usey bechney se) inkar kiya, siwaey-iske ke haq 'walaa' unka ho. Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne ye baat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kahi to aap ne farmaya : ye shart tumhen ( neki se) na rokey , kyonke haq 'walaa' usi ka hai jisne aazad kiya."
"3788","Sulaiman-bin-Bilal ne hamein Abdullah-bin-Dinar se khabar di, unhon-ne ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne 'walaa' (sarparasti) ko bechney aur hiba (deney,hadiya) karne se mana farmaya, Ibrahim ne kaha : maine Muslim-bin Hajjaj ko ye kehtey huey suna : is hadis mein tamam log Abdullah-bin-Dinar hi par inhisaar (nirbhar) karne waley hain. (sab sanadein unhein par aa kar mil jati hain.)"
"3789","ibne-Uena , Ismail-bin-Jafar , Sufiyan Sory , Shoba , Ubaidullah aur Suhak-bin-Usman sab ne Abdullah-bin-Dinar se, unhon-ne Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se aur unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se usi ki tarah riwayat ki, siwaey-iske ke Ubaidullah se ( abdul-wahaab ( Saqfi ki riwayat ki hui hadis mein sirf khareed aur farokht ka zikr hai, unhon-ne hiba ka zikr nahi kiya."
"3790","Hazrat Jabir-bin-Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) kehtey hain : Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne (meesaaqe-Madina mein) diiyaton ( uqool ( ki adaaeygi qabeeley ki har shaakh par lazim thehraai, phir aap ne likha : kisi musalman ke liye jaaiz nahi ke kisi (aur ( musalman ki ijazat ke baghair iske ( Maula ( ghulam ko apna Maula ( haqe-'walaa' rakhney wala ( bana ley. phir mujhey khabar di gaee ke aap ne, apne saheefey mein, us shakhs par jo ye kaam karey, laanat bheji."
"3791","Suhel ne apne walid ( Saleh samaan ( se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jisne apne aazad karne walon ki ijazat ke baghair kisi (doosri ( qaum ki 'walaa' ikhtiyar ki, is par Allah ki aur farishton ki laanat hai. aur (qiyamat ke roz (us se koi sifarish qabool ki jaeygi na fidya."
"3793","Sheban ne Aamash se isi sanad ke sath hadis bayan ki, albatta unhon-ne kaha : jisne apne aazad karne walon ke siwa , unki ijazat ke baghair kisi aur ke sath mawalat ki."
"3794","Ibrahim Taimi ke walid Yazeed bin Sharik se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha : Hazrat Ali-bin abi-Talib (Raziallahu anhu) ne hamein khutba diya aur kaha : jiska guman hai ke hamarey paas kitabullah aur us saheefey ke siwa. kaha : wo saheefa unki talwaar ki niyam se latka hua tha. padhi. koi aur cheez hai jisey ham padhtey hain to wo jhoota hai. usmein ( diyat wghaira ke) oonton ki umrein aur zakhmon (ki diyat ( se mutaalliqa kuchh cheezein ( likhi hui ( hain. aur is mein (ye likha hua hai ke) Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : Jabale-eir se lekar Jabale-sor tak Madina haram hai, jisne usmein (gumrahi phailaney ki) koi waardat ki ya waardat karne waley kisi shakhs ko panah di to is par Allah ki, farishton ki aur sab logon ki laanat hai, qiyamat ke din Allah Taala us se koi sifarish qabool karega na badla . tamam musalmanon ki panah aik hai. unka adna aadmi bhi kisi ko panah de sakta hai. jisne apne walid ke siwa kisi ki taraf nisbat ki ya (koi ghulam ( apne aazad karne waley maalikon ke siwa kisi aur ka Maula bana, is par Allah ki, farishton ki aur sab logon ki laanat hai, qiyamat ke din Allah Taala us se koi sifarish qabool karega na fidya."
"3795","Ismail bin abi hakeem ne mujhey Saeed bin Marjana se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se aur unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jisne kisi momin gardan ( momin ghulam jiski gardan mein ghulaami ka tauq tha) ko aazad kya, Allah Taala us ( aazad kiye janey waale) ke har uzu (khaas ang) ke badley us ( aazad karne waale) ka wahi uzu (khaas ang) aag se aazad farmaeyga ."
"3796","Ali-bin Husain ne Saeed bin Marjana se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se aur unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki ke aap ne farmaya : jisne kisi momin gardan ko aazad kya to Allah Taala uske har uzu (khaas ang) ke badley us ( aazad karne waale) ke aaza mein se wahi uzu (khaas ang) aag se aazad farmaeyga yahan tak ke uski sharmgah ke badley uski sharmgah ko bhi."
"3797","Umar-bin ( Zainul-Aabedeen ( Ali-bin-Husain (bin-Ali-bin-abi-Talib ( ne Saeed-bin-Marjana se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko ye farmatey huey suna : jisne kisi momin ko aazad kiya, Allah Taala uske har uzu  (ang) ke badley (is aazad karne waley ka wahi ( uzu (ang) aag se aazad karega, yahan tak ke uski sharmgah ke badley uski sharmgah ko bhi aazad kar dega."
"3798","Waqid bin-Muhammad ne hamein hadis bayan ki, (kaha : ( mujhey Ali-bin-Husain (bin-Ali-bin-abi-Talib (ke sathi (shagird) Saeed-bin-Marjana ne hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne kaha : maine Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ko ye kehtey huey suna : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jis musalman ne kisi musalman ko aazad kiya, to Allah Taala uske (aazad kiye janey waale) har uzu (ang) ke badley iske wahi uzu (ang) aag se bacha lega. (Saeed-bin-Marjanane) kaha : jab maine Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se ye hadis suni to main nikla aur Ali-bin-Husain ke samney iska tazkira kiya to unhon-ne apna wo ghulam aazad kar diya jis (ko kharidney (ke liye ( Abdullah ( ibne-Jafar ne unhein das hazaar dirham ya aik hazaar Dinar dene ki pesh-kash ! ki thi."
"3799","abu-Bakar-bin-abi-Sheba aur Zuhair-bin-Harab ne kaha : hamein jareed ne Suhel se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne apne walid ( Abu-Saleh samaan ( se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : koi betaa walid ka haq ada nahi kar sakta , siwaey-iske ke usey ghulam paaey , usey khareedey aur aazad kar de. ibne-Abi-Sheba ki riwayat mein : koi betaa apne walid ka ke alfaz hain."
"3800","Wakee , Abdullah-bin-Numair aur abu Ahmed zubairi sab ne Sufiyan se, unhon-ne Suhel se isi sanad ke sath usi ki tarah riwayat ki aur un sab ne bhi ''koi betaa apne walid ka'' ke alfaz kahey."